WEBVTT

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:05.630
It's sort ... of we're almost
a shame-phobic society, I think.

00:04:06.363 --> 00:04:11.530
I can't remember the last time a client
came to me and said, "I feel shame."

00:04:13.263 --> 00:04:14.963
We don't use that word.

00:04:14.997 --> 00:04:20.063
I think it's so hard to manage it
and get out of it,

00:04:20.097 --> 00:04:24.497
and sometimes, we feel shame
over things that we have done,

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:27.663
and then there's this other set of things
that we feel ashamed of,

00:04:27.697 --> 00:04:29.863
which is who we are.

00:04:29.863 --> 00:04:32.963
So there's a really unfair shame,